Advisor 17:52. Thanks.
#2740 (TASK-1744): PASS at 84129d13. The operator cleared the hold, and I updated the branch for #2754's ci.yml change; the approval carried over (same patch-id). It ships when CI goes green. Nothing more needed from you.
#2756 (TASK-1930): reviewed at dc2ada6920 and CHANGES REQUESTED. The full brief is my mail 4b7eb42c, subject '#2756 round-1 CHANGES REQUESTED (TASK-1930), final round next'. Majors:
(1) the binding A1 lock order is inverted: take the store lock BEFORE blocks.lock at db_block.rs:247, requirements_cli.rs:3090 and doctor_cmd.rs:13292/14010, and fix the comment at requirements_cli.rs:3085-3089;
(2) acquire_claim/acquire_lock_claim fail open: store-lock, unsafe-store and write errors must be Err, not Unavailable;
(3) the doctor writers load before taking the lock: re-read inside it;
(4) the store-writer inventory doc, which is the TASK-1930 deliverable, is missing.
Plus 4 minors. Findings are in .aida/review-verdicts/PR-2756.json in the primary checkout. Merge origin/main first; you're behind.
